  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Supporting entrepreneurship and job creation especially for women and youth in Bhutan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective (Impact) of this action is to support Bhutan&#xbf;s 10X National Economic Vision to `build a resilient, inclusive, and sustainable economy that enhances the wellbeing of all Bhutanese, grounded in the principles of Gross National Happiness (GNH), Environmental Stewardship, and Equitable Growth&#xbf;.The Specific Objective (Outcome) of this action is to advance economic opportunities for women and youth in Bhutan.The Outputs to be delivered by this action contributing to the corresponding Specific Objective are:1.1 Enhanced enabling environment for economic inclusion of women and youth 1.2 Strengthened inclusive entrepreneurship ecosystem for women and youth, with increased capacity to support sustainable and climate-responsive enterprise models that generate jobs and economic empowerment.1.3 Increased access to finance for women and youth-led enterprises</narrative>
  </description>
